# proto-message: nexteggapp.taxprotos.common.v1.FormMapping
#
# What Form MO-1040 calls each concept, per tax year.
#
# Lines come from the 2025 Form MO-1040 as the Missouri Department of Revenue
# publishes it. Two-column lines are printed as, for example, 1Y and 1S, and
# are mapped that way. There are no amount codes: IRS Publication 1220 covers
# the information returns the IRS receives electronically, and a state return
# is not one of them.

